Let target be 5.
Let size be target plus 1.
Let ways be a list of size zeros.
Set item 0 of ways to 1.
For every count from 1 to target.
For every split from 0 to one less than count.
Let before be item split of ways.
Let after position be count minus 1 minus split.
Let after be item after position of ways.
Set item count of ways to item count of ways plus before times after.

Print item target of ways.
